WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.337
Lab 2 runs in a test subscription, never
production, and the authors haven't run it.

2
00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:09.095
Open the template in the portal
through the Advanced Editor,

3
00:00:09.095 --> 00:00:12.101
pick the test workspace,
and open all twelve tabs.

4
00:00:12.101 --> 00:00:17.038
Save a test copy, change one look-back,
and copy the Gallery Template back out.

5
00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:19.457
Validate the export: your edit fails,

6
00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:22.763
and so does the workspace
the portal saved into it.

7
00:00:22.763 --> 00:00:25.987
Record any other difference
the portal introduced;

8
00:00:25.987 --> 00:00:30.562
that confirms the item format, which
Learn doesn't document field by field.

9
00:00:30.562 --> 00:00:33.430
Then delete the test copy and the export.
